# Prompta uses the same-origin Cloudflare Worker API. No client API keys are needed.
# Run npm run setup to generate ignored .dev.vars and .prompta server configuration.
# Do not place the PIN, its hash, session secrets or Cloudflare tokens in VITE_* values.
# .dev.vars is read only by local Wrangler development; launch uploads the two
# server secrets to Cloudflare through stdin.
